/// Buying UNH back thirteen days after selling it at a loss: a wash sale on 10 shares (IRC section 1091). Axiom does not
/// see the 30-day window: this second line is the owner's statement of it. The disallowed loss on those 10 shares
/// goes into the cost of the new lot, a flow into the basis of fidelity from the place that parks disallowed losses;
/// tax.ax adds it back to short-term gains. The holding period does not tack.
2025-06-10 checking -> fidelity 10 UNH @ 302.21 USD
2025-06-10 wash-sale -> fidelity[2025-06-10].basis 1_978.60 USD   // disallowed loss, 10 x (basis - price)
