/// Employee stock purchase plan, January-June offering.
/// Offering date price 142.43, purchase date price 169.00: the plan buys at 85% of the lower, 121.07.
/// The purchase is `for me`: money the plan held becomes mine, shares I own.
/// The discount of 3_325.45 USD is pay: it arrives from a wages place, so it counts as wages, and as a basis flow it raises the cost of these shares to their value.
